{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_06",
  "title": "邂逅",
  "storyCode": "RI-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a0126292bcb67b0c08f6d98c40359de76093f830bce1ed0536c3beafee724562",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "大祭司，状态怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噢，我不得不说，开炮的声音吓到我了，我在开炮的时候差点就飞出去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我问的是大丑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是顺便提一下我的状况。大丑和预想的一样，连续开炮会导致过热。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是效果很好，嗯，我不得不说，效果非常好！虽然我确实被吓到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "总之回到部族之后，还要好好修一修！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嗯，这次的祭典太急了，大丑还没有准备好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "原本我想等大丑准备好再和其他部族商量重新举办祭典的，结果现在就举行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没关系，结果好就行了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还记得那些小家伙们看到大丑时脸上吃惊的表情！哈哈，太有趣了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嗯，目的已经达到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下来，这里将迎来新的秩序，新的时代！噢，机械时代！听起来太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你觉得叫“大丑时代”怎么样？哦，我觉得“大祭司时代”也不错，听起来和我一样酷炫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "就叫机械时代就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，你这孩子什么都好，就是太古板了，既然学习了外面的知识，就应该看到更多的东西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看我，这一身打扮，不觉得很潮流，很有知性吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "太矮了根本就看不到，不过潮流是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噢，算了，对不起，我不该和你聊这个话题，但是没关系，我会亲自为你挑选一套适合大酋长身份的衣服的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "衣服随便，比起这个，留在部族的人刚才传来消息，他们抢到了一个引擎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嗯，好像是从嘉维尔回来的载具上抢来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太好了，我迫不及待地想要看到它了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，这么一说，我直接去看看不就好了，那我先走了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "大祭司还是老样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，族长身边那只黎博利是谁啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是新来的吧？那是大祭司大人！开大丑的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么，我也想开大丑啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了吧，你是不知道，以前大丑还没完成的时候，天天爆炸，弄伤了好几个弟兄，到后来谁都不敢坐上去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然后大祭司大人就来了，别小看他，他每次被炸飞出去都能活着回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？这么厉害？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，虽然不知道他以前是哪个部族的，但是我们现在都叫他大祭司大人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？那边的不是尤吉吗？喂，尤吉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是你们啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不是和你哥哥在一起吗？你哥哥呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我正要为这个去找族长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蠢货，现在要叫大酋长！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，我正要为这个去找大酋长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大酋长，我哥哥得了石头病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "说萨尔贡语。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，是，对不起，我还不怎么熟练。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......他怎么得的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哥哥之前为了采到更多的矿，不顾我的反对一个人去了里面的矿区......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "那个蠢货，我不是说过绝对不能深入矿区的吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "他现在人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他现在被嘉维尔带走治疗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嘉维尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，嘉维尔好像真的成了医生，本来哥哥很难受的样子，她三两下就让哥哥看起来好多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......原来成为医生不是谎话吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘉维尔还让我给你带话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "她说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她说她有事来找你，她好像很生气的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿，肯定是被族长打败不服气！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错，族长那一下，轰！实在是太厉害了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你忘了叫大酋长！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也忘了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "烦死人了，混账，族长就是族长！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你才烦死人了！我就是改不过口来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我知道嘉维尔不是那种人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大酋长，我相信嘉维尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嗯，我也相信她，你的哥哥不会有事的。他在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在特米米的部族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "特米米......之后你再去接你哥哥吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我猜嘉维尔肯定是来要回她的引擎的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......除非她能赢过我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我承认，嘉维尔很强，但她认为自己的拳头就是一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我不认同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "如果她来要回引擎，那就再让她尝尝大丑的威力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......但我不会把引擎还给她的，这台引擎对我们部族，不，对我们的未来也很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刚才，你是不是提到了嘉维尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "燧石，你听到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回家里的床上喊你的大酋长吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你才是，让你阿母教你大酋长怎么喊吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerToken": "char_415_flint_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_415_flint",
      "portraitKey": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "你们太吵了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......克玛尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerToken": "char_415_flint_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_415_flint",
      "portraitKey": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "你不想让她来，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "她来，我会打败她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerToken": "char_415_flint_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_415_flint",
      "portraitKey": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "那就是不想。让我去阻止她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerToken": "char_415_flint_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_415_flint",
      "portraitKey": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "那我走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerToken": "char_415_flint_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_415_flint",
      "portraitKey": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你怎么回来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerToken": "char_415_flint_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_415_flint",
      "portraitKey": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "嘉维尔，在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啧，这个雨林好潮湿啊，才走半天背上就都是汗了，而且我都走了两天了也没见到一个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幸好我早就把泳装穿在里面了，这下倒是正好，直接用上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，爬上树看到的也只有树，嘉维尔说的祭典到底在哪儿啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "喂，有人吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "喂，嘉维尔，你的尾巴好细啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "喂，博士，你的兜帽是不是该换换了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "......啧，果然博士他们不在附近啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "唉，要是博士有什么闪失，我可怎么向阿米娅交代啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "虽然嘉维尔说看着博士应该可以放心......不对，以那家伙的性格，我真的可以放心吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "唉，越想越担心，要不然砍几棵树制造点噪音试试？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerToken": "char_415_flint_1",
      "operatorId": "char_415_flint",
      "portraitKey": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "......按照尤吉的说法，嘉维尔应该在这个方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "哇，我终于见到人了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "嗨，你好啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerToken": "char_415_flint_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_415_flint",
      "portraitKey": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "没见过的穿着，你是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "啊？你说啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerToken": "char_415_flint_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_415_flint",
      "portraitKey": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "听不懂我说的话吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "喂，不会吧，嘉维尔那家伙可没说过语言不通的事啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerToken": "char_415_flint_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_415_flint",
      "portraitKey": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "但是，看上去很强的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "喂，这就是这里人的待客之道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerToken": "char_415_flint_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_415_flint",
      "portraitKey": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "果然是个强者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerToken": "char_415_flint_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_415_flint",
      "portraitKey": "char_415_flint",
      "text": "在打败嘉维尔之前，先和你战一场吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "嗯？这家伙的发音好像提到了嘉维尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_summer",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "算了，我正心情不好呢，既然你要打，那我奉陪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
